      "frame_file": "01.png",
      "lines": [
        {"source_time": 2606, "text": "你以为自己想要一段关系"},
        {"source_time": 2606, "text": "或更多的钱与成就"},
        {"source_time": 2606, "text": "但你真正追逐的"},
        {"source_time": 2606, "text": "往往是它会带来的感受"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "total": 8,
      "subtitle": "先问：它让我感觉怎样",
      "frame_time": null,
      "frame_target_range": "43:35-44:26",
      "frame_file": "02.png",
      "lines": [
        {"source_time": 2606, "text": "关系背后可能是被爱"},
